### Query and keys: one token looks at all the others

Sentence: `a`, `cute`, `teddy bear`, `is`, `reading`, `.`

The token we are working on right now is **teddy bear**. It produces a **query** `q`. Every token in the sentence (including teddy bear itself) has a **key** `k`. The query is compared against every key.

